{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04DFB0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"假设机器真的拥有了智能，有办法证明吗？证明它不是单纯的高性能计算机，而是真正的人工智能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"两者有什么区别？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这取决于你如何定义“智能”……Snake。比如，现在正和你说话、发出这个声音的“我”，如果其实是AI呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":142,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"如果真正的我正坐在客厅里喝茶，而现在陪你说话的，只是模仿我思维的AI合成音声呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"别拿我开玩笑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不。你应该没办法证明我是真正的活人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这恐怕做不到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"哼。要是AI先进到即使把真人换掉也分辨不出来，难道还不能说它拥有智能吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"还是让人难以接受。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不过，这也算一种观点。Turing博士对AI智能的解释，大致就是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这种验证方法以他的名字命名，被称为Turing Test。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"话虽如此，这玩笑一点也不好笑。那个用你的声音唱歌的AI兵器可把我折腾惨了。我再也不想来一次。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"真遗憾。我还正打算差不多让AI来代替我陪你聊天呢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"饶了我吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}